  <data name="About_Description.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A mod manager for Wuthering Waves: organize mods by character, toggle them in one click, save presets and sync with 3Dmigoto. Your mod files stay in the XXMI Launcher folder, this app only manages them.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="About_DonateBody.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The software stays free, this is purely optional — scan it only if you found it useful and feel like chipping in. Skipping it changes nothing.</value>
